WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:06.460
Someone's asked about a car? Lovely! Let's make sure they never slip through the net.

2
00:00:07.565 --> 00:00:13.315
In Sales, press Add Lead. Type their name, where they found you, and their number.

3
00:00:17.872 --> 00:00:23.622
Add the car they want, and a quick note so anyone can pick it up. Then press Add Lead.

4
00:00:28.449 --> 00:00:33.069
Every lead lands here, with where they came from and how far along they are.

5
00:00:34.197 --> 00:00:42.087
When things move on, open the lead and change its status. Viewing booked, test drive, and then, hopefully, won!

6
00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:48.540
And the pipeline shows where everyone is, so you know exactly who to ring next.

7
00:00:49.691 --> 00:00:52.201
Right, go and get them on a test drive!
